        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "Rangsou kumma sam thai ethei ai",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Rangsou kumma samthai ethei ai,",
            "Poubaumei thei pui ching jao tat ni;",
            "Hei khou 7#@ kanloumei 7#@ hou ni,",
            "Jeih kumma talandui pat mei 7#@,",
            "Jianmei phei nuai rui thut nthan ni.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He kalvari (2)",
            "Nang rukhou guang hin binlou the;",
            "Thao lana hianmei 7#@ sat pat ro,",
            "Kajeih luang keimei thut nthan no.",
            "",
            "2. Kidron dui le nangni thao lana,",
            "Nang pou tari meita tijang tio;",
            "Joukhiang rui tari kim pulak khe,",
            "Tatna kajan nthanmei bam khou,",
            "Nchu njanga dui tijang o.",
            "",
            "3. Ata ninga tari tuang ethei,",
            "Kidron dui le tuna kao ethei;",
            "Hei khou 7#@ tijang lou ni tuang e,",
            "Nangta ninga tari pui tuang e,",
            "Abumang tat na dui tijang o.",
            "",
            "4. Ai tat sini bui tuang sulou ni,",
            "Poubaumei tari kim dui khang 7#@;",
            "Airui ram khat sini thai makge,",
            "Tat mu tat ni the kalvari thang,",
            "Kajeih luang keimei sini thutni."
          ]
        }
      },
